T&O Workforce Management

Feature / User Story

HC MT Dashboard

Description

Develop an automated HC MT Dashboard in Dataiku by integrating multiple workforce data sources, implementing business rules, generating workforce metrics, and producing a standardized dashboard for Workforce Management reporting.

Task 1
HC Line of Sight
Description

Develop the HC Line of Sight section of the dashboard by integrating Actual Headcount, Joiners, Transfers, Leavers, Fieldglass, and Job Requisition datasets. Generate Line of Sight metrics and dashboard hierarchy according to business requirements.

